+++## 3. Environment & Constraints
+++
+++| Item | Value / Constraint |
+++|------|--------------------|
+++| OS | Windows 11 |
+++| CPU | Intel Core i7-1260P (12C/16T, P-cores + E-cores) |
+++| iGPU | Intel Iris Xe (integrated, no discrete GPU) |
