+++## 2. Why OVMS?
+++
+++So far the model was called directly from `openvino_genai.VLMPipeline`. Moving to OVMS turns the model into a network service that other tools can call via the OpenAI API. This is a stepping stone toward integration with chat UIs, multi-client apps, and production deployments.
+++
+++**However, this path was abandoned.** See section 11.
