+++## 9. Known Risks & Mitigations
+++
+++| Risk | Likelihood | Mitigation |
+++|------|------------|------------|
+++| OVMS Windows GPU support is experimental | Medium | Fall back to CPU only if GPU fails; document exact error |
+++| Model needs a `graph.pbtxt` for GenAI engine | Medium | Generate one with OpenVINO export tools or use `--task text_generation` / `--task VLM` |
+++| OpenAI endpoint may differ from `/v1/chat/completions` | Low | Check OVMS docs; use `/v2/models/gemma/generate` as fallback |
+++| Long model load / compilation on first start | High | Enable OpenVINO cache via `OPENVINO_CACHE_DIR` |
+++| Port 8000 already in use | Low | Use `--port 8001` or another free port |
+++
