++++++++
++++++++### Start Server:
++++++++```cmd
++++++++call dist\windows\ovms\setupvars.bat
++++++++dist\windows\ovms\ovms.exe --config_path C:\Users\mohds\Documents\GitHub\openvino-artifacts\ovms_config.json --port 9000 --rest_port 8000
++++++++```
++++++++
